sequenceDiagram
    title Optimistic Streaming with Post-hoc Guardrail

    actor User as Customer
    participant Orch as Orchestrator
    participant LLM as LLM
    participant Guard as Guardrails

    Note over Orch, Guard: Input guardrail + RAG already passed<br/>(same as before this point)

    Orch->>LLM: Generate (streaming)
    activate LLM
    activate Orch

    par Stream to user
        loop For each token
            LLM-->>Orch: Token
            Orch-->>User: SSE event: token
        end
        LLM-->>Orch: finish_reason: stop
        deactivate LLM
    and Accumulate for guardrail
        Note right of Orch: Buffer tokens as they arrive
    end

    Orch->>Guard: Check full response (toxicity, PII, policy)
    Note right of Guard: (40ms)

    alt Guardrail PASS
        Guard-->>Orch: Pass
        Orch-->>User: SSE event: done
    else Guardrail FAIL
        Guard-->>Orch: Block (reason)
        Orch-->>User: SSE event: retract
        Note over User: Frontend blanks<br/>the response
        Orch-->>User: SSE event: error message
    end

    deactivate Orch

    Note over User, Guard: User sees tokens in real-time<br/>Risk: brief exposure to unsafe content before retraction<br/>A "still verifying" state is a middle-ground pattern